[? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#FFCC00'> </div></td><td>!} Golds: {!</td><td>!} [+ lvp_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if not unionist_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#000'> </div></td><td>!} [+ unionist_party_name +]: {!</td><td>!} [+ unionist_minus_bvp_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if not unionist_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#A2D8E0'> </div></td><td>!} Arcanists: {!</td><td>!} [+ bvp_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if not lvp_formed and gold_exist and not gold_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#D5AC27'> </div></td><td>!} Golds: {!</td><td>!} [+ gold_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if not other_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#a0a0a0'> </div></td><td>!} Other parties: {!</td><td>!} [+ other_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if kvp_formed and not concord_kvp_formed and not kvp_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#0087DC'> </div></td><td>!} KVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ kvp_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if not concord_formed and not traditionalist_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#3E88B3'> </div></td><td>!} Traditionalists: {!</td><td>!} [+ traditionalist_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if dnf_formed: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#003755'> </div></td><td>!} DNF: {!</td><td>!} [+ dnf_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if dsu_exist: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#6A1E1E'> </div></td><td>!} DSU: {!</td><td>!} [+ dsu_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if not royalist_split: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#7A3C00'> </div></td><td>!} Royalists: {!</td><td>!} [+ royalist_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]
[? if royalist_split: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#7A3C00'> </div></td><td>!} Royalists: {!</td><td>!} [+ royalist_gallax_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if nvf_exist and not nvf_gnu: {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#142e20'> </div></td><td>!} NVF: {!</td><td>!} [+ nvf_r +]% {!</td></tr>!} ?]
{!</table>!}

The Interior Ministry returns to Staal loyalist Edwin Hughes, while Edrik Halbridge retains his position as Economic Minister. <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> who have chosen to join the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> are generously rewarded with government positions.